// 4. Thread Safety:
//    - ChunkManager uses mutexes for thread safety
//    - Your World class also uses mutexes
//    - Make sure you don't hold both locks at the same time (potential deadlock)
//    - The current implementation is designed to avoid this

// 5. Integration with Proxies:
//    - When chunks are unloaded by ChunkManager, entities are removed from memory
//    - Your proxy system should handle entities disappearing
//    - Consider proxying entities in chunks that ChunkManager unloads
//    - You might want to call proxy_manager.entity_to_proxy() before unloading

// 6. Performance:
//    - ChunkManager runs I/O on a separate thread
//    - Loading/saving is async and won't block your main thread
//    - Chunks load within 1-2 frames typically
//    - Use the is_dirty flag to minimize unnecessary saves

